{"a":[23,28],"h":"<p>23.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"109\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 108.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.0 36.7 36.7 44.3 60.0 70.4 77.3 84.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 60.0 77.3 84.0 92.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve karinî demiştir. - Ya'ni yanındaki saık hak tealânın huzuruna ıhzar edip böyle demiştir <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"151\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 150.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 39.0 57.0 57.0 70.6 79.6 87.0 93.7 109.6 116.3 125.3 125.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 57.0 70.6 79.6 93.7 116.3 134.3\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bu benim yanımdaki hazır - Allah tealâ tarafından da o sâık ve şehîde veya Cehennem zebanîlerinden ikisine yahud te'kîden emir suretiyle birine şöyle hıtab buyuruluyor: 24. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"217\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 217.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.7 39.0 50.3 62.3 69.7 94.6 103.6 103.6 110.3 118.6 139.6 150.7 150.7 166.6 173.3 180.0 180.0 186.7 186.7 194.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"94.6 103.6 110.3 118.6 173.3 194.3 201.0\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> 27.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"100\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 100.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 36.7 36.7 44.3 60.0 70.6 77.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 60.0 77.3 84.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - bu karîn, Dünyada o kâfire musallat olup Âhırette beraber sevk olunan Şeytan olduğu şu sözünden bellidir: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"137\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 137.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 36.7 43.6 43.6 54.0 69.7 69.7 76.6 92.3 99.0 105.7 105.7 112.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.7 54.0 76.6 99.0 105.7 112.6 120.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Demek oluyor ki yarab, beni bu azıttı diye i'tizar ve şikâyet etmek istemiş o da bu yolda cevab vermiştir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"219\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 218.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 32.2 32.2 39.0 54.7 54.7 65.2 77.2 99.7 111.0 111.0 126.7 137.2 144.0 164.2 164.2 174.7 174.7 186.7 186.7 194.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 70.4 77.2 126.7 144.0 194.2 202.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - ya'ni kendisi haktan uzağa sapmış bulunuyordu da ben ona öyle yanaştım « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"334\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 334.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 24.0 24.0 30.7 30.7 39.0 48.0 64.4 64.4 75.0 81.7 90.7 90.7 95.2 102.7 102.7 118.4 118.4 129.0 135.7 146.2 146.2 153.0 173.2 173.2 183.7 183.7 199.4 199.4 208.4 208.4 220.4 220.4 227.2 234.0 252.0 263.2 263.2 279.7 290.2 297.0 317.2 324.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 48.0 75.0 95.2 135.7 153.0 227.2 234.0 252.0 279.7 297.0 324.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » der. 28.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"57\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 56.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 33.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 33.7 40.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah tealâ buyurur ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 148.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 30.0 39.0 55.4 62.3 70.4 70.4 79.4 79.4 93.7 100.4 100.4 113.3 120.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 30.0 39.0 93.7 113.3 124.4 132.0\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> benim huzurumda çekişmeyin <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"219\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 218.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 41.3 49.6 49.6 57.0 63.7 63.7 79.6 79.6 88.6 88.6 100.6 100.6 107.3 114.7 114.7 130.6 130.6 147.0 147.0 153.7 153.7 162.7 178.6 178.6 187.6 194.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"41.3 107.3 153.7 162.7 187.6 194.3 202.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> vaktıyle ben size veîd göndermiş iken - mukaddemâ Dünyada çalışma çağında kitablarla ve Peygamberlerle inzar etmiş, tuğyan edenlere böyle şiddetli azab edileceğini haber vererek tenbihler, tehdidler yapmış iken dinlemediğiniz halde şimdi, hisab ve ceza mevkıınde boşuna çekişmeyin. </p>"}